Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:08.38,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,4000,4580)\pos(650.323,452.389)}Episode 53\N\N\N\N\NLone Blade Meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:10.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the 19th year of the Jian'an era (214 CE),
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:13.00,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei styled himself \Nthe Lord of Yi Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:18.10,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,He gave amnesty and promotion to officials previously under Liu Zhang who submitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:21.82,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,He opened the granaries and treasury to aid the people, rewarded the troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:25.28,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,and granted promotions to the old subordinates from Jing Province as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:29.90,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,In this way, he earned the hearts of the officials, the people, and the troops in Yi Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:32.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Also, he sent an envoy to Jing Province
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:38.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,to generously reward Guan Yu, who guarded Jing Province, with gold and brocade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Zhang led a tiger into the west and invited his own defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.45,0:00:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But that Liu Bei promised to give back Jing Province after obtaining the Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.22,0:00:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now he has the Riverlands, yet there's still no reply about giving Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.39,0:00:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is vexing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.54,0:00:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.46,0:00:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Liu Bei is a mighty raptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:01:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With the Western Riverlands, he will harbor ambitions to invade Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.51,0:01:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Jing Province holds the upper stream of the Yangzi River.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.22,0:01:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If he were to invade, he could sail down the river at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With such a strategic location, \Nnaturally Liu Bei will not give up easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}It seems taking back Jing Province
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}must be done by force!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.06,0:01:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The Land of Wu has only just gained peace, \Nit is ill-advised to take military action.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.34,0:01:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:42.24,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328.495,458.667)}Zhāng Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐbù
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,that can make Liu Bei return Jing Province to my Lord by his own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:45.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(315.224,480)}Sūn Quán\NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What great plan do you have, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}The man who Liu Bei relies on is Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Zhuge Jin, his elder brother, is now under the command of my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.93,0:02:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}My lord, why not detain his entire family,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and send him into the Western Riverlands to tell his brother
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}that if Jing Province is not returned,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}the lives of Zhuge Jin's family will be in peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.74,0:02:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Then Zhuge Liang, for his brother's sake, \Nwill have to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Will Jing Province not be at your fingertips?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Though... Zhuge Jin is an honest gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I cannot bear detaining his family for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just assure him that it is a ruse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.82,0:02:43.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why not let Ziyu go to Chengdu himself, without detaining his family?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.82,0:02:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Should Ziyu be made to act in front of Kongming, he could make a slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, we shall act according to your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:02:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Ping just came from Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:22.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,470)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.45,0:03:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He said Yunchang heard of Ma Chao's martial prowess,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and that he wants to come have a match with Ma Chao.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yunchang comes here, two tigers will fight, and one will certainly be injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.15,0:03:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then if something happens to Jing Province, there will be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.40,0:03:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Strategos have an idea to prevent this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord need not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will write a letter to reply to Yunchang, and all will be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Without further ado, Strategos, if you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.46,0:04:09.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,460)}Zhuge Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,please have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos understands Yunchang well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:38.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Guan Ping can now return to Jing Province with this letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:40.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and stop Yunchang's trip here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Messenger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:58.95,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(305.921,476)}Zhūgě Jǐn\NStyled: Zǐyú
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Sir Zhuge Ziyu of Eastern Wu is at the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.18,0:05:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Zhuge Ziyu of Eastern Wu is at the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.70,0:05:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Show him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.42,0:05:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your elder brother coming here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.44,0:05:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,For Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,For Jing Province?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.98,0:05:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were anyone else, it would be no hindrance,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but with your elder brother, how should we respond?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I will welcome my elder brother first, after which matters will be clear. Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:05:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Elder Brother.\N-Second Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please accept a salute from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.27,0:06:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother, please rise, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please sit, Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.06,0:06:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, how are the sister-in-law and the nephews?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong, Elder Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister-in-law and nephews' lives are done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother is here in the Western Riverlands to demand Jing Province back, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Marquis of Wu is detaining Elder Brother's family, then it is my sorrow as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother need not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I do have a plan to return Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.16,0:07:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I involve Elder Brother and watch my sister-in-law and nephews suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.60,0:07:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Preposterous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.02,0:07:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan married his sister to me, and yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,he sent men to lure his sister back to Jiangdong while I was not present.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is intolerable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will muster the Riverland's armies and bring down my vengeance upon the South!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he still demand Jing Province then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.58,0:07:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.85,0:07:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu is holding \Nmy brother's family as hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:08:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jing Province is not returned, \Nmy brother's family will be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I live with my elder brother dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, for my sake,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,please return Jing Province to Eastern Wu for the lives of us brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that my Lord may pity the innocent \Nand return Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,for the sake of Strategos,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall split Jing Province into two halves,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and have the commanderies of Changsha, Guiyang, and Lingling, given to Sun Quan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:35.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now that an agreement is reached, \Nplease write a letter to General Guan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.38,0:09:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to cede the three commandaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.38,0:09:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyu, once you arrive at Jing Province, ask only with kind words.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My younger brother's temper is as hot as fire, even I am afraid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.48,0:09:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I shall act carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.78,0:10:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Writing the letter is not difficult, but if Yunchang sees my letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.32,0:10:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and does actually give the three commandaries to Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,then is it not a defeat brought by my own hand, \Nerasing our previous efforts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Yunchang's mind is unlike that of Yide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If this letter of my Lord's ordered him to {\i1}attack{\i0} the three commandaries of Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}he would raise arms and attack at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.72,0:10:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}But this is an order to {\i1}return{\i0} the commanderies to Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Thus, he will not follow the order blindly \Nand act without thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Though with such distance, \Nwhat if Yunchang makes an oversight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.66,0:10:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Would that not complicate matters?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Yunchang is adept at military command and strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}He knows the importance of Jing Province very well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}and he is a proud man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.99,0:11:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Therefore, he has no desire to surrender land to others easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.22,0:11:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My lord simply needs to temper the tone of the letter, and not provide a deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yunchang will be able to guess the true intent himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Rest assured, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, I shall write it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.53,0:11:54.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(317.107,466.424)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.62,0:11:58.63,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988.8,366.4)}Zhōu Cāng
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.10,0:11:38.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(272,360)}Jing Province
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.90,0:12:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Sir Xiang and Adjutant Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Xiang, Adjutant Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.18,0:12:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Young General, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.45,0:12:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Young General, It must have been rough along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ping, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.34,0:12:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How are your elder uncle, your third uncle, and Strategos Zhuge?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They are all well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:52.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(989.339,571.727)}Guan Ping
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.38,0:12:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you mentioned my wish to have a contest with Ma Chao?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.78,0:12:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos has written a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, please take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:05.80,Thinking,,0,0,0,,I have heard that General wishes to stage a competition against Mengqi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:07.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In my opinion...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos knows my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,With Imperial Uncle Liu's permission
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,to return commanderies Changsha, Guiyang, and Lingling to Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that General shall make the cession soon so that I may return.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:14:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the hand-penned letter by Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take a look, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My elder brother and I swore an oath at the Peach Gardens to restore the Han Dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Jing Province is a territory of Han, and I am ordered to defend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}How can I presume to give it to others?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A general in the field is not bound by outside orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:15:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General, my arrival is unlike the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.22,0:15:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu has detained my family as hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If I cannot get Jing Province back, he will kill my entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:09.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I hope that General has pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Sun Quan's ruse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How can it trick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General, why won't you show mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.66,0:15:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Green Dragon Crescent Blade has no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of the Strategos, please calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were not for Strategos, you would not return to Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.27,0:15:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,See him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.23,0:15:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan-!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.14,0:16:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle's letter did indeed ask Father to give the three commanderies to Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.41,0:16:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Would this not be disobeying uncle's orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.90,0:16:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}You are still young, you could not understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.13,0:16:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Keeping hold of the commanderies is your Uncle's true intention.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.57,0:16:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Relinquishing them would go against your Uncle's wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand. I hope Father can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan sending Ziyu alone to ask for Jing Province
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,is a ploy to gag Strategos' mouth using fraternal love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your uncle, hindered by Strategos' situation, \Ncould not refuse directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.58,0:16:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He had to feign acceptance, \Nand send Ziyu here to let me refuse him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How can your Uncle give Jing Province, a place of strategic import, to others?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.70,0:17:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Although your Uncle wrote the letter, this must also be within Strategos' plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.26,0:17:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ziyu has returned so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.84,0:17:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Perhaps as a show of gratitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, General Guan refused to make the cession!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:17:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave Imperial Uncle's letter to General Guan and asked with kind words,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but General Guan turned away heartlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.49,0:17:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did he refuse to make the cession, \Nhe also humiliated me, and even threw me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.22,0:17:33.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Second Brother is still so quick to anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come, come. No need to be sad. Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.86,0:17:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding a way to convince General Guan will require Imperial Uncle's support.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang has a staunch personality and is very difficult to convince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:18:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I usually cannot do anything myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.82,0:18:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and your brother Kongming is out on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.46,0:18:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way would be for Ziyu to return for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.90,0:18:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When I obtain the east side of the Riverlands and Hanzhong, I will cede Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What does Ziyu think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Preposterous!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.50,0:18:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ziyu's been back and forth and all for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Only a few empty words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be Zhuge Liang's ruse?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kongming begged for me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then did Liu Xuande agree to return the three commanderies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all because of Guan Yunchang's ruthless and outrageous attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.29,0:19:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we have Liu Bei's word on returning the three commanderies to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I shall send three officials to their assignments in Changsha, Guiyang, and Lingling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What can he do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,An excellent idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord, we went to the commanderies of Changsha, Guiyang, and Lingling,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but in one day, we were driven out by Guan Yunchang!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't run we could have lost our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.73,0:19:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu, you lout.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You have gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Attendant.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to Lukou at once and summon Lu Su to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.62,0:20:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, it was you, Commander, who spoke for Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:22.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(316.588,460)}Lǔ Sù\NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted me to lend Jing Province to Liu Bei,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,who promised he would return it when he took the Western Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.73,0:20:27.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now Liu Bei has broken his promise, and Guan Yu refuses to return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zijing, as Commander...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as the guarantor, what ideas do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.94,0:20:37.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I too feel upset about this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Thus, I have devised a plan to suggest to my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.94,0:20:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.74,0:20:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We garrison troops at Lukou, across the river from Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we send someone to invite Guan Yunchang to cross the river for a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If he is willing to come, we shall convince him with kind words.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:21:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If he is uncooperative, then kill him with soldiers laid in ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, Jing Province can be taken in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.54,0:21:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does not come, we seize Jing Province directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My thoughts exactly. Execute this plan immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.07,0:21:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.10,0:21:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, this plan is infeasible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.53,0:21:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Guan Yunchang is a tiger general of our times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.76,0:21:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,His valiance and power is far above ordinary men.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a bit of negligence could bring harm. I hope that my Lord is careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.90,0:21:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If we hesitate and remain indecisive like this, when can Jing Province be obtained?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Lǔ of Eastern Wu has sent an envoy with a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.34,0:21:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.02,0:21:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:22:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan, Commander Lu invites you to cross \Nthe river for a meeting tomorrow at Linjiang Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.82,0:22:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Zijing invites me, you can tell the Commander that I will be there tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.35,0:22:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Jichang, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.18,0:22:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's time for me to place a stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.37,0:22:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Father, Lu Su most certainly bears ill intent, why accept his invitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.81,0:22:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}I understand his true intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.97,0:22:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Zhuge Jin told Sun Quan that I am not giving up the commanderies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.74,0:22:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Therefore, he ordered Lu Su to garrison Lukou and invite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.74,0:22:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}It is a ploy to strong-arm me into giving up Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.49,0:22:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Not going would be a sign of weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.26,0:22:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Tomorrow, I will take the small boat, with only a couple retainers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.61,0:23:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I will go alone with only my glaive. \NLet us see how he will approach me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.96,0:23:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Father, how can you approach the tiger's den by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.66,0:23:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}This wouldn't be what Uncle wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.49,0:23:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With your back against the Yangzi River, what if something happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.87,0:23:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}How can Father handle it alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I have fought amongst a forest of spears and swords, \Ndone battle amidst arrows and stones,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.68,0:23:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and I have ridden through all as if none of it was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.66,0:23:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}How can I fear those Jiangdong rats?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Young General's words are not without reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Lu Su usually has an elder's demeanor, but the current situation is critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.28,0:23:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}The possibility of evil intentions cannot be ruled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Going there rashly is ill-advised, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:46.74,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Lìn Xiàngrú（藺相如) is a politician and general of Zhào-state circa early 3rd century BCE. \NHe is the origin of many famous stories and chengyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}In the past, Lin Xiangru of Zhao, without an ounce of strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.56,0:23:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}looked down on the monarch of Qin at Mianchi, as if he was nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.75,0:23:49.88,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,The Miǎnchí Meeting（澠池之会): A famous meeting between King Huìwén of Zhào and King Zhāoxiāng of Qín.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.88,0:23:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}and returned the Heshibi to Zhao intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.92,0:23:51.88,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Héshìbì（和氏璧): The jade disk from which the Heirloom Seal of the Realm（傳國玉璽）is carved.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.06,0:23:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I have studied strategies since youth and have experienced many battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Once a promise is made, it cannot be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.34,0:24:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If General wishes to go, you should be well-prepared, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.54,0:24:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ping, my son, choose ten fast ships and five hundred naval troops and wait on the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.90,0:24:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, when I raise the signal flag, cross the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.84,0:24:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.62,0:24:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Yunchang is not without cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.90,0:24:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be suspicious of my invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.62,0:24:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be bringing soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.38,0:24:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, let him bring his soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.34,0:24:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard of this man's fame, \Nbut I have never seen him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.62,0:24:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I will see how powerful he really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.70,0:24:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We will see...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.85,0:24:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If Guan Yu brings troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.14,0:24:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Gan Ning and I will each lead a troop to lay an ambush by the sides of the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.18,0:24:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,On Commander's command, we will attack together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.06,0:24:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If no troops come,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.86,0:25:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,we can simply lay fifty swordsmen and axemen in ambush behind Linjiang Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.18,0:25:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we hear Commander smashing a cup as a signal, we will kill him in his seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.18,0:25:15.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(945.672,480)}Gān Níng \NStyled: Xīngbà
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.70,0:25:22.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,It seems that a slaughter will be unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.97,0:26:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.54,0:26:23.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(949.765,480)}Pān Zhāng \NStyled: Wénguī
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.22,0:26:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.86,0:26:45.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Good river wind, carry on this light raft.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.14,0:26:54.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Swelling waves and turning tides,\Nlet it stir our valor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.06,0:26:59.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Why fear the dragon's lair \Nor tiger's den,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.58,0:27:03.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}through the forest of swords \Nand spears I've braved.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.02,0:27:08.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Not for I to slight \Nthe heroes of the realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.90,0:27:13.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}for is "the Spring and Autumn" \Nkept in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.02,0:27:18.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Brotherhood and honor \Ngreater than mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.90,0:27:22.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Loyalty and sacrifice \Ngreater than words.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.42,0:27:32.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}In that Peach Garden, \Nwhence our oath was sworn,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.74,0:27:36.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sworn I have my body, \Nand this glaive of green dragon's-
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.38,0:27:40.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sworn I have my body, \Nand this glaive of green dragon's-
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.58,0:27:48.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sworn I have my body, \Nand this glaive of green dragon's-
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.38,0:27:59.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}-for the lives of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.62,0:28:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Act by my command, do not act rashly.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.70,0:28:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Just a boatsman and a couple sailors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.02,0:28:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How bold! Isn't this basically suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.22,0:28:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Suicide? Back then, he felled Hua Xiong when the wine was still warm,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.29,0:28:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,killed Yan Liang, slayed Wen Chou, \Ncrossed five passes, and cut down six generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.70,0:28:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a god descending to the mortal world, \Nfull of majesty. Just you see!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.70,0:29:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you have been well since last we met, General Guan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.14,0:29:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your kind invitation, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.78,0:29:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arrival is a great honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.75,0:29:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Greetings, sir. \N-Greetings, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.14,0:29:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.14,0:29:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.14,0:29:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.22,0:29:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.90,0:29:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.70,0:29:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.46,0:30:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General Gan, do not be rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.74,0:30:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes Guan Yu so extraordinary?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.59,0:30:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He dares to bring only eight or nine followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.73,0:30:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This arrogance, he's clearly looking down at us of Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.96,0:30:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see what he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.98,0:30:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,General Gan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.74,0:30:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Fifty swordsmen and axemen are enough for killing those two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.70,0:30:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what the Commander will do, and then we act.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.62,0:30:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.78,0:30:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.46,0:31:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}After Gongjin's passing, you succeeded him as Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.98,0:31:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}We do not meet with each other often, with you garrisoning at Lukou.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.22,0:31:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}For what purpose have you invited me today?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.44,0:31:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I have heard that Imperial Uncle has obtained the Western Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.70,0:31:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}and styled himself the Lord of Yi Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.86,0:31:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}General has been conferred a new title, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.14,0:31:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}For these reasons, I have prepared some wine for you, sir, as congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.46,0:31:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Please, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.00,0:31:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is the case, thank you, Commander, for your kindness. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.64,0:31:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a word, and I hope that you lend me your ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.70,0:31:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.77,0:31:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, your brother Imperial Uncle Liu was defeated, coming from afar without a place to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.02,0:32:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It was I who served as guarantor for Marquis of Wu \Nto lend Jing Province to Imperial Uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.70,0:32:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,who promised to return it after gaining the Western Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.54,0:32:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, Imperial Uncle has the Riverlands, and yet Jing Province is not returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.55,0:32:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this not a breach of trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.61,0:32:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a matter of the state, and is not suitable to be discussed during a banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.70,0:32:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.43,0:32:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiangdong is small, and the Marquis of Wu was willing to lend Jing Province
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.28,0:32:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,only because of the benevolent fame of Imperial Uncle and yourself, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.14,0:32:48.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,For this, he was willing to offer assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.78,0:32:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Recently, Zhuge Ziyu entered the Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.36,0:32:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and Imperial Uncle agreed to return the three commanderies,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.88,0:32:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but you, sir, disobeyed, which seems to defy reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.40,0:33:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you invited me for a banquet to ask for Jing Province back?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.56,0:33:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the truth of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.94,0:33:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,As you, sir, are here, please do speak your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.10,0:33:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Back then, during the fierce battle of Chibi,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.67,0:33:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}my brother Imperial Uncle Liu fought through the rain of arrows,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.36,0:33:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}and Strategos Zhuge made an all-out effort,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.34,0:33:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}all to defeat Cao with Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.06,0:33:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}They all deserve great credit for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.94,0:33:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}How could they not be rewarded with a single bit of land?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.60,0:33:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Today, you come to ask for Jing Province again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.34,0:33:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}This is entirely the matter of my elder brother's, my involvement is unsuitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.07,0:33:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Besides, Jing Province originally belonged to Liu Biao.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.43,0:34:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Liu Biao and my brother Imperial Uncle Liu, are both members of the Imperial Clan of Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.70,0:34:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Is it unreasonable that my elder brother should inherit the Han's estate?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.44,0:34:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,These words are incorrect, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.90,0:34:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How are they incorrect?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.36,0:34:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Back then, you, sir, and Imperial Uncle were defeated
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.56,0:34:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}and forced to flee with strength exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.89,0:34:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My lord, sympathizing the Imperial Uncle, granted land without prejudice,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.90,0:34:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}so that Imperial Uncle would have a foothold from which to reestablish himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.44,0:34:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Today, however, Imperial Uncle has damaged our relations and gained the Western Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.02,0:34:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and occupied Jing in betrayal. \NIs this not a subject of ridicule across the realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.93,0:34:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}I hope that you, sir, take notice!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.86,0:34:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is entirely the matter of my elder brother, and my involvement is unsuitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.22,0:35:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that the Imperial Uncle and you swore an oath to live and die together.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.50,0:35:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Imperial Uncle is you, \Nand you are the Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.70,0:35:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you shirk from this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.62,0:35:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you laugh, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.38,0:35:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If Commander wants Jing Province back, just say so directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.09,0:35:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why set up this Hongmen Banquet?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.74,0:35:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Since you know my intent, pray tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.17,0:35:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,will you return Jing Province or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.42,0:35:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The world under Heaven can only be claimed by the virtuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.51,0:35:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why should Eastern Wu dictate its possession?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.38,0:35:51.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.66,0:35:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is a matter of the state, it is not your place to speak. Stand down!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.18,0:35:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.87,0:36:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.45,0:36:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,this is meant to be a banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.27,0:36:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us not discuss Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.32,0:36:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.18,0:36:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear I may act unkind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.10,0:36:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, I shall invite Commander to come to Jing Province...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.50,0:37:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...to talk more. How does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.77,0:37:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.36,0:37:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Commander, for sending me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.34,0:37:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.73,0:37:52.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320.682,480)}Lǚ Méng\NStyled: Zǐmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.26,0:38:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Commander. Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.90,0:38:14.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu, with his extraordinary courage and unparalleled daring,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.26,0:38:20.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,thwarted another of Eastern Wu's conspiracies to take Jing Province back,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.50,0:38:25.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,leaving for the ages the story of attending \Na deadly ambush alone and armed with only a blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.82,0:38:28.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan, greatly angered by the news,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.79,0:38:32.88,Thinking,,0,0,0,,desired to raise the troops of his entire domain to take Jing Province by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.10,0:38:38.12,Thinking,,0,0,0,,However, he suddenly received the news of Cao Cao attacking with three hundred thousand troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.16,0:38:41.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He had to move his soldiers northwards to meet Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.70,0:38:45.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and set the Jing Province affair aside.
Comment: 0,0:35:24.26,0:35:31.98,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Hóngmén Banquet (鴻門宴): A plot by Xiàng Yǔ, the Hegemon of Western Chǔ, to assassinate Liú Bāng, \Nfuture Emperor Gāozǔ of Hàn, by inviting him to a banquet and killing him there in 206 BCE.

